cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LAGMX"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, config-driven Python tool that automates the preparation,
  equilibration, and production stages of GROMACS molecular dynamics
  simulations for protein-ligand complexes, with first-class support for
  multiple ligands per complex.
type: software
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-09-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/laode-aman-ung/lagmx"
url: "https://github.com/laode-aman-ung/lagmx"
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - GROMACS
  - drug discovery
  - computational chemistry
  - structural bioinformatics
  - protein-ligand complex
